flowchart TB
  P((A)) --> A{MODEL_API_KEY<br/>set?}
  A -->|Yes| B[Model branch: send the facts,<br/>the stories and the last six<br/>messages, ask for JSON]
  B --> C{Good answer<br/>in 20 s?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Use its two or three sentences<br/>and up to three painting slugs,<br/>swap long dashes for commas]
  C -->|No| E
  A -->|No| E[Fallback branch: the facts of the<br/>best match and the first line of<br/>its story, or I'm not sure about<br/>that one when nothing matches]
  D --> G[Save the question and the answer<br/>in the conversation, a new one gets<br/>a title from the first six words]
  E --> G
  G --> G2{Request<br/>worked?}
  G2 -->|No| G3[/The guide is resting<br/>right now. Try again<br/>in a moment./] --> R1((B))
  G2 -->|Yes| H[/Answer with up to three<br/>painting cards/]
  H --> I{Another<br/>question?}
  I -->|Yes| R2((B))
  I -->|No| X([End])
